{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034_02_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b8e23591e9d78360aebaedf9cc585858a9a96475ec1db8302c325df195ff1381",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00605ce0d896777e97c20eb510b9e3f6d5cdbbe2479d722f50bf057b37fd5e6b",
      "text": "“兴奋期待”与“坐立不安”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0827763c66e08529a85a1d44175bdd1e4379ec780db570d3848433b4ec1c9bf",
      "text": "花音的生日快到了。\n期待着能得到大家祝福的花音，\n却完全看不到制作人和直央他们\n在筹备生日的迹象……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000020:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000020:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00605ce0d896777e97c20eb510b9e3f6d5cdbbe2479d722f50bf057b37fd5e6b",
      "text": "“兴奋期待”与“坐立不安”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a85345ddcef546c0055c9c4fcc4e6f5bcf7264d952e2d995f35a6056dc2fc235",
      "text": "（诶嘿嘿，马上就是花音的生日啦～！\n好兴奋♪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54421c8befd1875a401c9bed1b7867ff1ad1bc52c9034666ae6c05caadadaf0a",
      "text": "（直央君和志狼君，还有制作人，\n今年肯定也一定会给我庆祝的吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f061cae3b0824f7c3ecf2252eb74497e0bcc7cd908020cfe14e8e5cea0cc662b",
      "text": "（会有什么礼物呢，好期待呀。\n会不会有生日派对呢？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46456039dd6bad2b28d4b04095413115ddfeccb041d35635394eabfa30b60508",
      "text": "（呜～好想快点知道！\n不过，到生日为止要忍耐，忍耐）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0c4eed4de04e2f8d663e00685bc5986615177b8964b5b9b426578556ea37dce",
      "text": "各位，差不多该去练习室了。\n请准备一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d",
      "text": "好～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6397219d1f64128f1818738590705881fd2e4dc88d00e75be7ad3a139fa92471",
      "text": "今天的练习也是我要跳得\n最最最帅气的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9879431095b834ae22f3d34d27a29f7fefa053a6c32e108519172342895078",
      "text": "那个，志狼君。今天是要练歌哦。\n日期可能记错了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f008dd9451a59ddda3efd7f61409f6e3d9b05a451552020ee9b99b9364583318",
      "text": "我、我知道啦！\n我说的是自主练习啦，自主练习！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:39a721081ffc99fc749fe9cf4f299c5f2e3ebb5515766148de3c8825ad6e460c",
      "text": "志狼君，今天还要留下来练习吗？\n时间没问题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:05d56226b97e6a647485dda302d333021730d7ec306864d41216fb7de88f2203",
      "text": "噢！今天我很闲！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b820d94ae548a4b7cf48b41448683b223d4854e43f11dedc754874b0c5fdffa",
      "text": "（总觉得大家和平常一样……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_02_1_2_034_02:1_2_034_02_a:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d83e057b8dbf34304dde8391c76c159d8546c6e51cbdcfc3e23a1d5e4ec97c9f",
      "text": "（但是，为了给花音一个惊喜，\n大家一定是在保密对吧！）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
